    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get the theory but in the real world, when you see the economy fragmenting like this, isn't it pretty clear that these policies are just a step backward for everyone? seems like eventually the benefits to a few industries won't outweigh the massive cost to the rest of the global economy.",
